ow fidelity graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Banger heavy metal soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Upgrade your weapons and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529740/extras/7be53d6e30a6329ba4c720d1e641579c.poster.avif?t=1769193798\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529740/extras/7be53d6e30a6329ba4c720d1e641579c.webm?t=1769193798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529740/extras/7be53d6e30a6329ba4c720d1e641579c.mp4?t=1769193798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of all of these fancy new shooter games that have this so called  &quot;meaningful plot&quot;, the &quot;proper animations&quot; ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Well, worry no more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game a true classic goold ol' shooter: its dumb, it looks bad and you get to do a big &quot;boom&quot; and shoot very often.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY <i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You and your wife had a baby which suddenly died due to a rare disease. Wife could not live with this took her life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to religion, she will be tortured in hell for this. You decide that its not fair and you wont let your wife to be tortured, so you get yourself a shotgun, and decide to go to hell to get your wife back to you. &quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-First person shooter game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pass through 7 rounds of hell, killing demons standing on yo